The system demonstrates excellent architectural foundations and security practices. Addressing the fleet controller API_KEY issue and GitHub Actions problems will significantly improve reliability. With these fixes, the HyperCode-V2.4 platform is well-positioned for stable, secure operation as an autonomous AI infrastructure system.

